# Nested ignore — site-only ignores live here, beside what they cover, rather than
# in the root .gitignore. Git honours nested ignore files.
# HARD RULE: no clip/poster binary ever enters the git tree (hosted on the
# site-media GitHub Release, referenced by URL). See the spec §2/§5/§8.
#
# This convenience-ignores the common cases; the smoke's git-ls-files guard
# (landing.spec.ts) is the cross-platform enforcement layer (it is case-insensitive
# and catches anything these lowercase patterns miss on a case-sensitive filesystem).
media-local/
*.mp4
*.webm
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.gif
